"Yeouido Hangang Park","sight",37.52507,126.92553,"330, Yeouido-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu (8 Yeouido-dong)","","","","","r","One of Seoul's most popular riverside parks, with wide lawns and views of the Han River. It is popular for picnics, walking, and cycling, and bicycles can be rented nearby. The park is also a popular place to watch the sunset and hosts…"],["SeMA Bunker","sight",37.5259,126.9252,"","","","","","r","A rather mysterious former bunker built during the 1970s military government. It was discovered in 2005 during the bus transfer center construction, and was opened as a gallery in 2017. It is part of the Seoul Museum of Arts."],["Yeouido Park","activity",37.52681,126.92232,"120, Yeouigongwon-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu / 영등포구 여의공원로 120 (여의도동)","","","","","r","Enormous and hugely popular park. This site was an airfield until 1971, and was used as Seoul's main airport before Gimpo Airport. There is a traditional Korean forest, and in many other places you can enjoy concerts, cycling, or taking…"],["SEOULDAL","activity",37.52634,126.92225,"68-1 Yeouigongwon-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu","Tu-Th Su 12:00-22:00, F Sa 12:00-23:00 (Aug-Oct); closed M. Weather dependent","","","","r","A tethered helium balloon that rises up to 130 m above Yeouido Park, offering panoramic views of the Han River and Seoul skyline. Each flight lasts about 15 minutes."],["E-Land Cruise – Yeouido Dock","activity",37.52587,126.93841,"280 Yeouidong-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu","Daily 11:00-22:00; departure times vary by cruise","","","","r","Sightseeing cruises departing from Yeouido on the Han River. Programs include daytime sightseeing, sunset, night, music, and dinner cruises, with routes offering views of Seoul's riverside skyline and bridges. Passengers should check…"],["Yeouinaru Station Runner Station","activity",37.52685,126.93253,"B1F, 343 Yeouidong-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu","Daily; storage lockers 06:00-00:00","","","","r","A facility for runners inside Yeouinaru Station, designed as a base for running along the Han River. It has changing rooms, lockers, powder rooms, shoe sanitizers, an InBody analyzer, and information on running routes and events.…"],["Itama-e","restaurant",37.52113,126.92413,"108 on Capitol Hill","11:30-21:30","","","","r","A 15-year-old Yeouido Japanese izakaya restaurant with authentic Japanese cuisine and side dishes based on raw fish aged with fresh sashimi"],["Waba","bar",37.5228,126.9263,"42, Yeouinaru-ro, Yeongdeungpo-gu","17:00-02:00","","","","r","A long-running beer chain popular for affordable drinks and group gatherings. Lively in the evenings, especially near Yeongdeungpo Station."]]}